{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in the enormous underworld? Stuck on a puzzle? Missed out on some of the hundreds of quests? Want to explore all of the enormous world of Avernum? Get the Avernum 4: Greed and Glory Hintbook and Extras! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Avernum 4 Hintbook contains a full walkthrough for the main storyline and all side quests! It's full of maps, tips, locations of the best spell upgrades, and other help to get you unstuck. The Hintbook also contains a full list of cheat codes to heal your characters, boost their power, and cheat in a variety of amusing ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This deluxe kit also contains the full documentation and exclusive desktop art and wallpapers only available in this package. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directions to use the DLC: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Right click (Control-click on Mac) &quot;Avernum 4: Greed and Glory&quot; in the games list in your Steam library. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Select &quot;Properties.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. In the &quot;Local Files&quot; tab, select &quot;Browse Local Files.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. All your goodies are in the &quot;Deluxe Edition&quot; folder. You can drag them to your desktop for easy access.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006550?t=1761137888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006550/be051e063955c5a5a962e2b98dde3391421a08a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761137888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006550/aff73c61df7ffdbea1cad016af05566d3f0d135c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761137888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006550/aff73c61df7ffdbea1cad016af05566d3f0d135c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761137888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in the enormous underworld? Stuck on a puzzle? Missed out on some of the hundreds of quests? Want to explore all of the enormous world of Avernum? Get the Avernum 4: Greed and Glory Hintbook and Extras! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Avernum 4 Hintbook contains a full walkthrough for the main storyline and all side quests! It's full of maps, tips, locations of the best spell upgrades, and other help to get you unstuck. The Hintbook also contains a full list of cheat codes to heal your characters, boost their power, and cheat in a variety of amusing ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This deluxe kit also contains the full documentation and exclusive desktop art and wallpapers only available in this package. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directions to use the DLC: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Right click (Control-click on Mac) &quot;Avernum 4: Greed and Glory&quot; in the games list in your Steam library. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Select &quot;Properties.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. In the &quot;Local Files&quot; tab, select &quot;Browse Local Files.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. All your goodies are in the &quot;Deluxe Edition&quot; folder. You can drag them to your desktop for easy access.</p>","developers"